<section class="hero wrap"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">FOR THE DOG YOU LOVE. AND THE LIFE YOU SHARE.</p><h1>Small steps.<br>A little more<br><em>peace of mind.</em></h1><p class="lede">When alone time feels difficult, knowing what to notice is a place to start. A thoughtful guide and workbook for you and your dog.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="#the-kit">Meet your calm-alone kit <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="{{ 'guide-preview.pdf' | asset_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Take a look inside</a></div><p class="micro">English PDFs · Fillable & printable workbook · One-time purchase</p></div><figure class="hero-photo"><img src="{{ 'bea.jpg' | asset_url }}" width="1200" height="1600" alt="Bea, the black and tan dog with expressive ears behind Bea and Co." fetchpriority="high"><figcaption><span>Meet Bea.</span> The heart of our little project.</figcaption><span class="photo-note">Made with<br><em>dogs in mind.</em></span></figure></section>
<div class="values-strip"><span>A real dog at the heart</span><span>Clear, practical notes</span><span>Room for your own pace</span></div>
<section class="wrap intro section-space"><p class="eyebrow">YOU DON'T HAVE TO KEEP IT ALL IN YOUR HEAD.</p><h2>A place for the questions.<br>And the <em>small observations.</em></h2><p>What happened before you left? What looked comfortable? What changed today? Bring the scattered notes together, so your next step - and your next conversation with a professional - can be clearer.</p></section>
<section id="the-kit" class="kit-section"><div class="wrap kit-grid"><div class="product-art"><img class="cover" src="{{ 'guide-cover.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Actual cover of Bea's Calm-Alone Guide" width="530" height="750" loading="lazy"><img class="worksheet" src="{{ 'workbook-preview.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Actual fillable session record from the workbook" width="530" height="750" loading="lazy"><span class="art-caption">A guide to read. A workbook to make your own.</span></div><div><p class="eyebrow">THE BEA & CO. CALM-ALONE KIT</p><h2>Less guesswork.<br><em>More useful notes.</em></h2><p>A practical companion for observing your dog, planning support and recording the everyday moments around leaving.</p>{% render 'kit-includes' %}{% render 'kit-buy',kit:kit %}<p class="micro">3 PDF files · 22 pages in total · No physical delivery</p></div></div></section>
<section class="wrap section-space"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">A SIMPLE WAY TO USE YOUR KIT</p><h2>Read. Notice. <em>Reflect.</em></h2></div><div class="steps"><article><span>01 / READ</span><h3>Start with the guide.</h3><p>Understand the purpose of the kit, its limits and when to ask for professional help.</p></article><article><span>02 / NOTICE</span><h3>Make room for detail.</h3><p>Capture the setting, action and response. Write what you saw, including what you aren't sure about.</p></article><article><span>03 / REFLECT</span><h3>Bring the notes together.</h3><p>Review patterns and questions. Use them to support an individual plan with your professional.</p></article></div></section>
<section id="meet-bea" class="meet-section"><div class="wrap meet-grid"><figure><img src="{{ 'bea.jpg' | asset_url }}" width="1200" height="1600" alt="Bea looking directly at the camera" loading="lazy"></figure><div><p class="eyebrow">THE DOG BEHIND THE NAME</p><h2>Those ears.<br>That face.<br><em>That's Bea.</em></h2><p>Bea is our founder's dog and the heart of Bea & Co. A real companion behind a project built around thoughtful, everyday care.</p><p>Our kit is owner-created. It makes space for each dog's needs, without promising that every journey will look the same.</p><span class="signature">With care, Bea & Co.</span></div></div></section>
<section class="wrap section-space fit"><div><p class="eyebrow">IS THIS FOR YOU?</p><h2>A companion for<br><em>your next step.</em></h2></div><div><h3>A useful fit if you want to...</h3><ul><li>Organise observations around alone time.</li><li>Keep reusable session and weekly records.</li><li>Prepare clearer questions for your veterinarian or behaviour professional.</li></ul><div class="note"><strong>Support, with clear limits.</strong><p>This is an educational guide and workbook, not a diagnosis or personalised treatment. If your dog experiences severe distress, injury or frantic escape attempts, seek prompt veterinary help.</p></div></div></section>
<section id="questions" class="faq-section"><div class="wrap faq-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">A FEW THINGS YOU MIGHT WONDER</p><h2>Good questions.<br><em>Honest answers.</em></h2></div><div>{% render 'faq' %}</div></div></section>
<section id="contact" class="wrap section-space contact-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">GET IN TOUCH</p><h2>A question<br><em>about the kit?</em></h2><p>For file access or product questions, send a note. For your dog's health or individual behaviour plan, please contact a qualified professional.</p></div><div>{% form 'contact' %}{% if form.posted_successfully? %}<p role="status">Thank you. Your message has been sent.</p>{% endif %}{{ form.errors | default_errors }}<label for="ContactName">Your name</label><input id="ContactName" name="contact[name]" autocomplete="name" value="{{ form.name | escape }}"><label for="ContactEmail">Email</label><input id="ContactEmail" type="email" name="contact[email]" autocomplete="email" required value="{{ form.email | escape }}"><label for="ContactMessage">How can we help?</label><textarea id="ContactMessage" name="contact[body]" rows="4" required>{{ form.body | escape }}</textarea><button class="button" type="submit">Send a note ↗</button>{% endform %}</div></section>
